  <para style="h">Ñwed Mbon Filipai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ñwed Mbon Filipai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ñwed Mbon Filipai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ñwed Mbon Filipai</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ekọọm ye Akam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Pọọl ye Timoti, mme isʌñutom Krais Yisọs, ewet ñwed ami enọ afịd ndisana ikọd Abasi ke Krais Yisọs e-ebaaha ke Filipai, adiana ye mme adaiwuod ufọkabasi ye mme dikịn. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Yak mfọn ye emem a-atooho Abasi Ete ñnyịn ye Abọọñ Yisọs Krais aba ye ndufo.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Ami mmesikọọm Abasi mmi afịd ini a-ami itoiyoke ndufo. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Ke afịd akam se ami mbọñ nnọ afịd ndufo, ami nsibọñ ye inemesịd afịd ini <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />ke ntak a-ndufo ekeeneke ewuana ke eti etob tọọñọ ke akpa usen tutu asịm idahami. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Ndin mmenịm ke ayọhọ akpanikọ nte ke anye a-aketọọñọke eti utom ke idem ndufo ayaaben anye akesịm utịd tutu usen Krais Yisọs.<verse eid="PHP 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Ado nnen-nnen ñkpọ ami adinie utọ udọñ ami mbaña afịd ndufo, sia ami mminie ndufo ke esịd. Adooho ami nsịne ke akpọnọ me anyʌññọ ado ñnwana ke unen me ke adisọọñọ akpanikọ eti etob, afịd ndufo emekeene ewuana ke mfọn Abasi ye ami. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Abasi akeme aditie ntiense mbaña naña afịd ndufo eñwʌt miin ke ima a-atooho Krais Yisọs.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Ndin akam mmi ado yak ima ndufo adọdiọñ akpon ke ifiọk ye ntəño ikike, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />nọ ndufo ekan ediọọñọ ñkpọ se ifọn ikan enyʌñ enana ndo tutu usen Krais, <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />eyọhọ ñko ye mfịd adinenido, a-atooho Yisọs Krais ke ubọọñ ye itooro Abasi.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpakọb Pọọl Anam Eti Etob Atara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Nditọeka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek adelfọi a-awuọñọke </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nditọeka </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ideen ye ibaan</char><char style="ft" closed="false">anyʌñ asʌk ada anọ ideen ye ibaan e-enịmme Krais ke akpanikọ, ke atu ubon Abasi; se ñko ke Filipai 1:14; Filipai 3:1, 13, 17; Filipai 4:1, 8, 21</char></note> ke Krais, ami ñyem ndufo ediọọñọ ke se ikitịppe innọọ miin anenekke anyaaña ke adinam eti etob atara. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Ke ntak ami, a-anekke anwaña afịd mme akpeme akwere adidem ye afịd mbon mfen ke ami mba ke ñkpakọb ke ntak Krais. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Ato ke ntak akpọnọ mmi, uwak mme nditọete ke Krais enie nsọọñọidem ke Abọọñ enyʌñ enie uko aditañ ikọ Abasi ifegheke ndịk.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Ado akpanikọ ke usʌk awo ekwọrọ Krais ke ufịb ye utọk, ado usʌk awo enyʌñ ekwọrọ ke eti esịd. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Mbon e-ekwọrọke ke eti esịd enam ado ke ima, ediọọñọ ke ensịn miin mi ke ntak adifaaña nnọọ eti etob. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Mbon e-ekwọrọke ke utọk ye ufịb ekwọrọ Krais ato ke udọñ adiwọt idem ammọ, idooho ke akpanikọ, ekere ke mmimọ imikan inam insịn miin ke ntịme ke ini ami nsịneke ke ñkpọnọ. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Ado ufọn aba mọọ? Akpan ñkpọ ado ke afịd usʌñ, me ato ke nsu-nsu udọñ me ato ke akpanikọ, esʌk ekwọrọ Krais. Ndin ato ke ntak ami esịd mmi anem.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:18">Ii, ami ñyaasʌk ñkakaiso adinem esịd, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />sia ami mmediọọñọ ke ayaato ke akam ndufo, ye unwam Abasi a-Sịbidịd Yisọs Krais anọọhọ, ñkpọ se ikitịppe ami innọọ miin ayaakappa ado ñkpọ adinyaaña annọ miin. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Ami ke udọñ esịd mmi nsʌk nse ñnyʌñ nsʌk ndot anyen mbo ke ndiikoppo abuud ke baaba usʌñ ndomokeed, ado ke ñyaanie ayọhọ nsọọñọnda nọ ato do, idahami ye ke afịd ini, eyaebenne Krais ke idem mmi, adooho ke uwem me anyʌññọ ado ke ñkpa. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Ke idem mmi, adidu uwem ado Krais, adinyʌñ ñkpa ado udod. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Adieke anaaha ami ñkaiso ndu ke abʌkidem, ami adiido utom a-anwịmme mfịd annọ miin. Kpayeado, nsoo ke ami ndiimek? Ami ndiọọñọke! <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Ami nda ke ufọọd ñkpọ iba ami: Ami mmenie udọñ adikpọñ ñnyʌñ mba ye Krais, a-atʌmmọ afọn akan, <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />ado anekke anie ufọn inọ ndufo ami adiba ke abʌkidem. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Sia ami mmenekke ñyʌkkọ ke ado, mmediọọñọ ke ñnyaasʌhọ mi ye afịd ndufo ke ntak ufọn ndufo ye inemesịd ke mbuọdidem, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />nọ ato do ke ami adimaana mba ye ndufo, inemesịd ndufo ke Krais Yisọs adiyọhọ aduọiyọ ke ntak mmi.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwem A-adotto Eti Etob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Naña akpedodo, ikama idem ndufo ke usʌñ a-adotto ye eti etob Krais. Ndin me ami ndedi ndikịt ndufo me ñkokop ibaña ndufo ke ini mmembaaha, ami ñyaadiọọñọ ke ndufo emesọọñọ eda ke Sịbidịd keed, enyʌñ ediana keed esịn ukeme ke abaña mbuọdidem eti etob. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Ikiiyak ndịk inam ke ntak mbon e-enwanake ye ndufo. Ami ado idiọọñọ anọ ammọ ke eyaesobo ammọ ado ke Abasi ayainyaaña ndufo. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Sia, ke iwuod Krais emainọ ndufo unen, idooho adinịm anye ke akpanikọ ikpọọñ, ado adinyʌñ mbọọ ufen ke ntak amọ, <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />sia adooho esʌk enie ukem mfịna a-ndufo ekekịtte naña ami nnie, e-enyʌññọ ekop ke ami nsʌk nnenie.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s1">Adidubọiyọ Nsuukidem Krais</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Adieke adooho ndufo emesọọñọ ukod ke adidiana ye Krais, adieke ebọọhọ idọñesịd eto ima amọ, adieke enieghe ewuana ke Sịbidịd, adieke enieghe mmem-mmem esịd ye mbọm, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />inam inemesịd mmi ayọhọ ke ndufo adinie esịd keed, ke adinie ukem ima, ke adido keed ke Sịbidịd ye akikere. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Ikiinam ñkpọ ndomokeed ke akpọsọñ ndomoidem me ñkokkoidem, ado ke nsuukidem idat nte ke mbon mfen e-efọn ikan ndufo. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Ndufo keedekeed ikiiyem udʌk idem ndufo, ado iyem udʌk mbon mfen.<verse eid="PHP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Ke ewuana ndufo ye emọ-emọ inie ukem esịd unam ñkpọ nte ake Krais Yisọs:<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />A-adooho ke ataa uduud amọ, anye ado Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">ado ikikereke ke ido ñka ye Abasi, ñkpọ akpekedooho ke ufọn idem amọ;<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />utu ke ado, anye amaasuuhọ idem amọ, akappa ado ñkaña ñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">atịmme amek itie ayịnufọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">sia emaekenam anye ke mbid awo.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Ndin sia ekekịtte anye nte awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">anye amaasuuk idem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">amọ anyʌñ asuuk iwuod tutu asịm ñkpa,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:8">kpa ñkpa ke krọs.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Ke ntoro, Abasi amaadịppe anye akesịm ñkoñ ñkan itie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">anyʌñ anọ anye anyịñ a-akoñño akan afịd anyịñ,<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />nọ ato do, ke anyịñ Yisọs afịd edọñ editọọñọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">ke anyọñ ye ke isọñ ye ke idak isọñ,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />ñko afịd edeme etañ ke Yisọs Krais ado Abọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">ke ubọọñ Abasi Ete.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ke Ndukuunọ Aba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Ke ntoro, mme ndima ufan mmi, kpa naña ndufo esikop item afịd ini, idooho ke idaha a-ami mbaaha kpọd, ado akpan-akpan ke ini ami mmiibaaha, ika iso inam utom adinyaaña ukpọñ ke ndịk ye ñnyeñidem. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Sia ado Abasi anam utom ke atu ndufo, mbaak ndufo ekan enam nọ asaña akekem ke uduak amọ ye se inem anye esịd.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Inam afịd ñkpọ ke unana ndukuunọ ye mfaaña, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />nọ ndufo ediinana ndo, enyʌñ esana nte “nditọ Abasi, i-imiinieghe ndudue ke ukwañ idiọọk emana ami.” Ndin ndufo eyaeyamma ke atu ammọ nte ntantaafiọñ ke ikpaanyọñ, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />nte ndufo emʌmmọ ikọ uwem ami ekama. Ndin ami ñyaakan nnam asian ke usen Krais nte ke ami ñkifegheke, ñkinyʌññọ ñkpa utom ke ikpu-ikpu. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Ado akpekọm ekpeñnwaanwañña miin eduọk nte ukọd uwa ke ñwaidem ye utom a-atooho mbuọdidem ndufo, ami mmenem esịd ñnyʌñ ndaara ye afịd ndufo. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Ke ntoro, akpena ndufo ñko enem esịd enyʌñ edaara ye ami.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Timoti ye Epafrọditus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Ami mmenie idodanyen ke Abọọñ Yisọs adidọñ Timoti ibịne ndufo usọp-usọp, nọ ami ñko ñkop inemesịd ke adikop ñkpọ ibaña ndufo. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Ami nnieghe awo ndomokeed mfen a-abitte anye, a-adiinie eti akikere ibaña mme ñkpọ se ifọn ye ndufo. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Sia afịd awo esʌk eyem udod ammọ ikpọọñ, iyemme ake Yisọs Krais. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Ado ndufo emediọọñọ ke Timoti ibaaha ntoro, sia kpa naña ayịn anam utom ye ete ke anye anam utom eti etob ye ami. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Mmekere adidọñ anye usọp-usọp ke mmadọdiọọñọ naña ñkpọ abono ye ami. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Ndin mmedot anyen ke Abọọñ ke ami ke idem mmi ñyaadi ke ini imiidiikpeeneke.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Ado ami mmekere ke a-adot ami adimaana ndọñ Epafrọditus, ayịneka mmi, inọọ ndufo, anye a-adooho nsaña utom ye emọ-emọ awo ekọñ, a-anyʌññọ ado isʌñutom ndufo, a-ndufo ekedọññọ ebo adise ñkpọ ambaña miin. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Sia anye a-anie udọñ adikpikịt afịd ndufo, ndin anye afʌhọ ke ndufo adikikop ke idem imọ ikisọññọ. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Anye amaadọñọ ke akpanikọ akpere ñkpa. Ado Abasi amaanie mbọm abaña anye, ikinieghe inọ anye ikpọọñ, ado amaanie annọ miin mbaak ndiben mfʌhọ ndian ke mfʌhọ. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Ke ntoro, ami mmenekke nnie udọñ adidọñ anye inọọ ndufo, nọ ato do ndufo imaimaana ikịt anye, ndufo ekop inemesịd, ñko ami ñnyʌññọ nnie mbʌññọesịd aba. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Idaara anye ke Abọọñ ye ekamba idaara, inyʌñ ikpono mme awo e-ebaaha nte anye, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />sia anye amaakpere ñkpa ke ntak utom Krais, utuanyen anye adiduọọk uwem amọ ke abaña unwam a-ndufo imiikikanna innọ miin.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kuunie Idodanyen ke Abʌkidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Ke akpatre, nditọeka mmi ke Krais, idat esịd ke Abọọñ! Idooho mfịna innọ miin adimaana ñwet ukem ñkpọ ami inọọ ndufo, sia ado ñkpọ se ifọn ye ndufo. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Itịñ anyen ise mme ewa ado, mbon e-enamma idiọọk, mme andisappa abʌkidem. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Sia ado ñnyịn ido mme afọọrọ edʌd, ñnyịn i-ikponoke Abasi ke Sịbidịd amọ, ñnyịn i-ikamake Krais Yisọs iduaak inua, i-imiinyʌññọ inie idodanyen ke abʌkidem, <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />akpesʌkado ami ke idem mmi mmenie mme ntak adinie utọ idodanyen ado.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 3:4">Adieke awo ndomokeed akereke ke iminie mme ntak adinie utọ idodanyen ado ke abʌkidem, ami mmenie awak akan. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Ekemfọọrọ miin edʌd ke ayọhọ usen itiaita, nto ubon Isrel ke ufọk Benyamin, awo Hibru ke ubon Hibru, ke ñkañ mbed ndo awo Farisi; <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />ke adikinie udọñ adikọbọ ufọkabasi; ke adinen ke mbed, ñkenieghe ndudue ndomokeed.<verse eid="PHP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Ado afịd se ikido udʌk innọ miin, ndikịt idahami nte ntakudua ato ke ntak Krais. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Akanna ado, ami ñkịt afịd ñkpọ nte ntakudua ke ntak ananambid ekọmudua ifiọk adidiọọñọ Krais Yisọs Abọọñ mmi, a-adooho ke ntak amọ ke afịd ñkpọ akappa ado ntakudua. Ami ñkịt afịd ammọ nte mbio ke itoon, nọ ato do ami nnie Krais nte udʌk, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />enyʌñ eñkịt miin ke anye. Ñko, ami nnieghe adinenido ake mmi a-atooho mbed, ado anye a-atooho mbuọdidem ke Krais, adinenido a-atooho Abasi ke ntak mbuọdidem ke Krais. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Ami ñyem adidiọọñọ Krais, ye adudu adised ke ñkpa amọ ye adikeene ñwuana ke mme ukuud amọ, adikappa mba nte anye ke ñkpa amọ, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />ndin naña akpedodo, adikeene ñko ñwuana ke adised mme akpañkpa.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Idooho nte ami mmebọbọi afịd mme ñkpọ ami, me ke emaenanam mfọn mma, ado ami nsʌk ñnwanwana ñkaa iso adikimʌm ñkpọ ado a-Krais Yisọs akedatta ammʌm miin. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Nditọeka ke Krais, ndatta idem mmi nte mmemʌm anye ñkama diin. Ado ñkpọ keed ke ami nnam: Adifre mbaña se imaikiboiyo ndin ñnyanna mbịne se inaa ke iso. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Ami nsʌk ñnwana adikisịm itie edikan nọ mbọ ñkpọ ayịnutom nduba A-Abasi akeñkoodo anọ abio Abasi ke Krais Yisọs.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adikeene Uwọdñkpọ Pọọl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Afịd ñnyịn i-ikponno inyʌñ idiọọñọ idem akpena ida ikịt mme ñkpọ ke utọ usʌñ ami. Ñko, ke abaña mme usʌk ñkpọ a-ndufo enieghe isio-isio akikere, Abasi ayaanam mme ñkpọ ado inwaña ndufo. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Naña adodo, yak nọ ñnyịn idu uwem nte asañake akekem ke itie a-ñnyịn imaikiwuọwuọ.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Nditọeka ke Krais, idiana ye mbon mfen ke edisaña ke uwọdñkpọ mmi, inyʌñ ise mbon eduuho uwem a-asañake akekem ke udomo a-ñnyịn ikinọọhọ ndufo. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Sia kpa naña ami nsima adidọkkọ ndufo tọọñọ ke akpa, ndin idahami, mmemaana ntañ ye mmọọñayịd ke uwak awo edu uwem nte mme asua krọs Krais. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Utịd ammọ ado nsobo, Abasi ammọ ado idịb ammọ, ndin ubọọñ ammọ asịne ke ñkpọ abuud ammọ. Esịd ammọ asịne ke mme ñkpọ ederimbod ami. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Ndin ñnyịn isʌk ibet ye udọñesịd Andinyaaña a-atooho hefịn, Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais, <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />a-adooho, ke adudu a-anọọhọ anye ukeme adiben afịd ñkpọ nsịn ke idak amọ, anye ayaanam usuuhọ-usuuhọ ikpọkidem ñnyịn akappa atie nte idem ubọọñ amọ.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ke Abaña Nsọọñọnda ye Adidiana Keed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Ke ntoro, nditọeka ke Krais, ndufo a-ami mmaaha ñnyʌñ nnie udọñ nnọ, inemesịd mmi ye anyanya mmi, ado naña ndufo ekpesọọñọ eda ke Abọọñ, mme ndima ufan mmi!<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Ami mmekpeiye Eyudia ye Sintike nte enie esịd keed ke Abọọñ. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Mmenyʌñ ibeeñe ndufo, mme nsaña utom mmi nte enwam ibaan ami, sia ammọ ekedaaha ye ami ke adinam utom eti etob, ye Klemen ye afịd mbon ñko e-eñkeeneke enam utom, a-adooho anyịñ ammọ mmọdo ke ñwed uwem.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpatre Ikọitem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Idaara ke Abọọñ afịd ini, yak nsʌk mmaana ntañ, idaara! <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Yak afịd awo ekịt ke emenie ifuuro-ifuuro uwem. Abọọñ a-akpere. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Ikiiyak mfịna ndomokeed ifịna ndufo, ado ke afịd ñkpọ, ke akam ye ebeeñe ye ekọọm, iben mme ebeeñe ndufo inịm Abasi ke iso. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Ndin emem Abasi a-akanna afịd ifiọk, ayaakpeme esịd ndufo ye akikere ndufo ke Krais Yisọs.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Ke akpatre, nditọeka ke Krais, ñkpọ akeedodo a-adooho akpanikọ, ñkpọ akeedodo a-anieghe ukpono, ñkpọ akeedodo a-anenne, ñkpọ akeedodo a-asanake, ñkpọ akeedodo a-ayaiyake, ñkpọ akeedodo a-adooho se ema, adieke ñkpọ adooho se etooro, ikere ibaña mme ñkpọ ado. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Se adodo a-ndufo emaekekpeep me ebọbọ me ekokop ento miin, me ekekịt ke idem mmi, isịn mme ñkpọ ado ke adinam. Ndin Abasi emem ayaaba ye ndufo.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pọọl Akọọm Mbon Filipai ke Enọ Ammọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Ami mmenem esịd eti-eti ke Abọọñ sia ke akpatre udọñ ndufo adise ñkpọ imbaña miin amaana ademme. Ke akpanikọ, ndufo emaenie udọñ adise ñkpọ imbaña miin, ado ikinieghe ufañ ye ifed adinam ntoro. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Ami ntañña ami ke ntak a-adooho mmeyem unwam, sia ami mmaakpeep adiyʌkkọ ke naña akpebaba. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Ami mmediọọñọ naña aba awo adiba ke unana, mmenyʌñ ndiọọñọ naña aba adinie uwak. Ami mmekpeep ndedịbe ifiọk a-abaaha ke adiyʌkkọ ke itie akeedodo ye ke afịd idaha a-ami ñkịtte idem mmi, me mmedia ñyʌkkọ me nsaña abiọọñ, me mba ke eduek me ke unana. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Ami mmekeme adinam afịd ñkpọ ato ke anye annọọhọ miin adudu.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Kpayeado, amaafọn ndufo adikeene ñwuana ke mme ukuud mmi. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Mfen ñko, nte ndufo mbon Filipai ediọọñọke, ke mme akpa ini a-ndufo ekediọọñọke eti etob, ke ini a-ami ñketọọñọke isañ nto ke Masidonia, ufọkabasi ndomokeed ikiwanake ye ami ke adinọ me adibọ, ibọhọke ndufo ikpọọñ. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Sia ke idem ini a-ami ñkebaaha ke Tesalọnika, ndufo emaemaana enọ unwam ensọk, emaana enọ ensọk ke ini ñkpọ akesọññọ ye ami. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Idooho nte ami ñyeyem enọ ndufo, ado ntañ mbaña se ediidat iwet isịn ke ñwed ibad ndufo. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Ami mmebọ afịd se akenaa eñkpe me se ikakan ado. Ennọ miin ñkpọ mfọn-mfọn, akpan-akpan idahami a-adooho mmaakebọi nto Ebafrọditus mme enọ a-ndufo ekenọọhọ ensọk. Ammọ edo mme anemufịk enọ, uwa a-adotto, a-anemme Abasi esịd. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Ndin Abasi mmi ayainọ ndufo afịd se ndufo eyem nte asañake akekem ke mme inie ubọọñ amọ ke Krais Yisọs.<verse eid="PHP 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Yak ubọọñ anie Abasi ye Ete ñnyịn ke nsi-nsi nsi-nsi. Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Akpatre Ekọọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Ikọọm afịd ikọd Abasi ke Krais Yisọs.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 4:21">Nditọeka ke Krais e-ebaaha ye ami e-enọ ekọọm.<verse eid="PHP 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Afịd ikọd Abasi e-ebaaha mi edọñ ekọọm inọ ndufo, akpan-akpan mbon ufọk Sisa.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Yak mfọn Abọọñ Yisọs Krais asʌhọ ye Sịbidịd ndufo. Amen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed inieghe </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Amen</char></note><verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>